gantt
    title Bank Loan Management System - Project Schedule
    dateFormat  YYYY-MM-DD
    axisFormat  %b %d

    section Planning
    Project Initiation           :p1, 2024-01-01, 7d
    Requirement Gathering        :p2, after p1, 14d
    Feasibility Study            :p3, after p1, 10d

    section Analysis
    Requirement Analysis         :a1, after p2, 14d
    SRS Document Preparation     :a2, after a1, 10d
    Use Case Modeling            :a3, after a1, 7d

    section Design
    System Design                :d1, after a2, 14d
    Database Design              :d2, after a2, 10d
    UI/UX Design                 :d3, after d1, 10d
    Architecture Design          :d4, after d1, 7d

    section Development
    Frontend Development         :dev1, after d3, 30d
    Backend Development          :dev2, after d4, 35d
    Database Implementation      :dev3, after d2, 14d
    API Development              :dev4, after dev2, 14d
    Integration                  :dev5, after dev4, 10d

    section Testing
    Unit Testing                 :t1, after dev2, 14d
    Integration Testing          :t2, after dev5, 10d
    System Testing               :t3, after t2, 7d
    User Acceptance Testing      :t4, after t3, 7d
    Bug Fixing                   :t5, after t3, 10d

    section Deployment
    Deployment Preparation       :dep1, after t4, 5d
    Production Deployment        :dep2, after dep1, 3d
    Post-Deployment Support      :dep3, after dep2, 10d
    Documentation                :dep4, after dep2, 7d
